From: 1q9lugp <lackowork84@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:17:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 24/30] v3d: implement fragment image load store and atomics on
 3.3

Lower image accesses to bounds-checked general TMU memory operations with uniforms for resource layout. Handle linear, UBLINEAR and UIF tiling, layers and mip levels, and all ES 3.1 plus NV_image_formats formats.

Use a mapped dummy read to supply a final uniform thread switch after conditional accesses. Account for image writes when preserving resources and invalidating sampler shadows.

Hardware gates: 264 format/layout cases, 145 layered/mip cases, four contended atomic sizes and 12 official fragment early-test cases pass. Full graphics regression is running on the equivalent scratch library; GLES 3.1 remains disabled pending compute.
